WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Could a cheap steroid save lives in hospitalized Covid-19?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
RECOVERY randomized 6425 patients patients to dexamethasone or usual care.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
28-day mortality: 22.9% with dexamethasone versus 25.7% with usual care.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
On invasive ventilation: 29.3% versus 41.4%. Rate ratio 0.64.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
On oxygen alone: 23.3% versus 26.2%. Rate ratio 0.82.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
No respiratory support: 17.8% versus 14.0%. No benefit.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Dexamethasone lowered deaths in patients on oxygen or ventilation. N Engl J Med, 2021. Scroll for the full breakdown.
